{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area01_title", "source_sha256": "bc072eaa0ffc317adaba252796f26ba64459de8c73efc916f3a475afaa3e0e62", "ja": "新しい私たち", "zh": "崭新的我们", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "edc3f756c52fe3da401f9ab3adcdb27a5b60b9fc0deccefbf1e52a003915f96d", "ja": "765プロオールスターズのライブツアーに\n新人である一期生もダンサーとして参加\nすることになり、準備を進める律子たち。\nレッスンについて来られるかという懸念に\n新人プロデューサーは太鼓判を押す。", "zh": "765全明星的巡回演唱会决定让\n作为新人的一期生也作为伴舞参加，\n律子等人正在推进准备工作。\n面对她们能否跟上练习进度的担忧，\n新人制作人给出了十足的保证。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area01_1000_null", "source_sha256": "112204b7c34aef6fe406176699daed268bedfcd00a60ddd6ae888b1a1aa97cdb", "ja": "某日、ライブツアーに関する打ち合わせ中……", "zh": "某日，关于巡回演出的会议中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area01_1001_402cpr", "source_sha256": "7f8e544c72cea9705a617d0e433f9edcd4d2c03eed20c75d4cae243bf4cc349c", "ja": "よし、セトリも決まったし大筋は作れたかな。\nレッスンも厳しくなるけど、頑張ろう！", "zh": "好，歌单定下来了，大体框架也搭建好了。\n接下来的训练也会变得严苛，一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area01_1002_009rit", "source_sha256": "d2314165a8d564c84182430f4dc0d502c83784e3d25d24f1ae3ff54bed11afb3", "ja": "千早と響の提案、結構そのままですからね。\nこの難易度……。うーん、ホントに大丈夫ですか？", "zh": "千早和响的提议，基本上都原样采用了。\n这个难度……嗯，真的没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area01_1003_002chi", "source_sha256": "c9ad057a7c86804a9e1a6b8827f7dce077a2a03c819d74748a10a03d3f9bde25", "ja": "難しいかしら。\n今の私たちなら、できると思うけれど……。", "zh": "很难吗？不过，我觉得现在的我们应该能做到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area01_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "20e36f8046da2ceec9c956e390cdd0f7139c1059afd0c6f1a85a2291230cb9ca", "ja": "自分たちの全部を出さなくちゃ、\n最高の結果はついてこないからね！", "zh": "不拿出全部实力，就无法取得最好的结果！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area01_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "80aa385f781b3f46fa8b481ffa7b85de41d29648e339042e6a4420050bec351c", "ja": "もしかして……律子、自信ないんでしょ？\n大丈夫だぞっ、自分がついてるし！", "zh": "难道说……律子，你没有自信吧？\n没关系的，有我陪着你呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area01_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "46cffec93441efae4bcb580a2de7fef60bd3fa1bafb8b2c29133cdbc074b2f79", "ja": "響はひとりで突っ走っちゃうでしょ？　それに、\n後ろで踊る子たちも、ついてこられるかどうか……。", "zh": "响总是一个人冲在前面吧？而且，后面跳舞的孩子们也不知道能不能跟上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area01_1007_402cpr", "source_sha256": "43922a41c9732be13c0324fd62764792063793cf91644ab7ab74398c01d0748e", "ja": "あの子たちの事は、担当する期待の新人プロデューサー\nに聞いてみないとな。……どうだ、いけると思うか？", "zh": "关于那些孩子的事，得去问负责她们的那位备受期待的新人制作人了。……怎么样，你觉得能行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area01_1008_401pro", "source_sha256": "07c046170410e17ef0e2011d4ee2f46e9479570cf7c44631012db0fe2235396a", "ja": "えっ。ど、どうでしょう。\n確かに、難しい……とは思いますけど……。", "zh": "诶？这、这个嘛……\n确实，我觉得……挺难的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area01_1009_401pro", "source_sha256": "1ef9cbaa30ee3ecbc7ce82b071eaadb0af4410f5ef47f391fc241b3c24e50e55", "ja": "でもみんな、このツアーにかける気持ちは本物だと\n思います。やらせたい……いや、いけます！", "zh": "不过，我觉得大家对这次巡演的热情都是真实的。想让他们试试……不，他们一定能行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area01_1010_013hib", "source_sha256": "036528cc65260a0f25e77c885a4c80c9b332c1d4ceb15626894b3737ca07991e", "ja": "あっははは！　そう来なくっちゃね！", "zh": "啊哈哈哈！就该这样才对嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area01_1011_002chi", "source_sha256": "b74c8a567699a760d82d71a6295db4d0ec91abd7ec9fca1d7aec616f6a9351dd", "ja": "私たちも協力します。新しい765プロとして、\n語り継がれるようなライブにできればと……ね、律子。", "zh": "我们也会全力配合的。希望能作为新晋的765位制作人，打造出一场值得流传的演唱会……对吧，律子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area01_1012_009rit", "source_sha256": "92b756ebb9ae71a71a34bceaa0f674219e14bd3eb91259ac938dfab06a926baf", "ja": "……ああもう、わかりましたっ、覚悟を決めます！\nあの子たちは頼みましたからね、期待の新人殿～？", "zh": "……啊真是的，我知道了，我豁出去了！\n那些孩子就拜托你了哦，备受期待的新人大人～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area01_1013_401pro", "source_sha256": "7b0e722e523b6701497688065c1b630e02ba7e9f1f3f62d9700bdea78dc2d495", "ja": "はいっ……あ、いや。\nコホン、任せてくれ！", "zh": "是……啊，不对。咳咳，交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area01_1014_402cpr", "source_sha256": "5853eaa343518385ed7118ebdf9201c9e2f96fe354f70622b388502afa60816a", "ja": "そうそう、アイドルの前では胸を張って堂々とな。\nさあ、これから忙しくなるぞ！", "zh": "对对，在偶像面前要抬头挺胸，堂堂正正的。好了，接下来可要忙起来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
